{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/aee05b4c2cfb6c88f006bdeb5158b080.avif?t=1774295876\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras_big/aee05b4c2cfb6c88f006bdeb5158b080.avif?t=1774295876 width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Which came first \u2014 the chicken, the egg, or something else?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAMAGORUDO - Floor 0</strong>\u00a0 is an atmospheric psychological horror game. As you just clipped\u00a0into the Backroom you will explore a liminal and spooky environment in First-Person. But you will soon discover there is something wrong with this floor.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/f0aa321ad2d8ffaf7d4486cc40173f03.poster.avif?t=1774295876\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/f0aa321ad2d8ffaf7d4486cc40173f03.webm?t=1774295876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/f0aa321ad2d8ffaf7d4486cc40173f03.mp4?t=1774295876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find yourself stuck in this parallel floor, trying to break out of the loop of a chicken-or-the-egg paradox. Will you find the answer to this endless question? Or will some unstoppable forces keep you away from the truth? Maybe some information left by previous explorers will help you understand the mysteries of this universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Informations :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAMAGORUDO - Floor 0 is a reboot of a viral game released in 2019. It will be released later in 2025 as a short single-player experience that may lead into more chapters in the future. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673050?t=1774295876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/4250ae371d4fc09daef6f68f144af2a54bf3df57/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774295876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/bdf3218f282e872c6603c570b5ecd9ef1934d08e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774295876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/bdf3218f282e872c6603c570b5ecd9ef1934d08e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774295876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/aee05b4c2cfb6c88f006bdeb5158b080.avif?t=1774295876\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras_big/aee05b4c2cfb6c88f006bdeb5158b080.avif?t=1774295876 width=800 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Which came first \u2014 the chicken, the egg, or something else?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TAMAGORUDO - Floor 0</strong>\u00a0 is an atmospheric psychological horror game. As you just clipped\u00a0into the Backroom you will explore a liminal and spooky environment in First-Person. But you will soon discover there is something wrong with this floor.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/f0aa321ad2d8ffaf7d4486cc40173f03.poster.avif?t=1774295876\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/f0aa321ad2d8ffaf7d4486cc40173f03.webm?t=1774295876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/extras/f0aa321ad2d8ffaf7d4486cc40173f03.mp4?t=1774295876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will find yourself stuck in this parallel floor, trying to break out of the loop of a chicken-or-the-egg paradox. Will you find the answer to this endless question? Or will some unstoppable forces keep you away from the truth? Maybe some information left by previous explorers will help you understand the mysteries of this universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Informations :\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAMAGORUDO - Floor 0 is a reboot of a viral game released in 2019. It will be released later in 2025 as a short single-player experience that may lead into more chapters in the future. </p>","developers":["TamagorudoTeam"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673050/446112f559066a9645cfbb7d90de00465c71e15d/header.jpg?t=1774295876","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673050/871465/0a220d17cf46d5b22a5869b7cd29ae7d8cb74a1d/1750397429/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745153354","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3673050/8714